---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="Learn-To Trips | Talon Expeditions" description="Skill-based travel built around learning to dive, sail, ski, surf, climb, mountaineer, and develop wilderness skills." image={images.surf}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.surf}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Learn-To Trips</p><h1 class="section-title">Go somewhere worth remembering. Come home able to do something new.</h1><p>Skill-based journeys that combine travel with instruction, progression, and the experience of learning alongside other people.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-split"><aside class="side-card"><p class="eyebrow">Build a skill trip</p><h2>Start with what your group wants to learn.</h2><p>We can shape the destination, instruction, support, and travel around that goal.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss a Learn-To Trip</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>Travel can be the setting for becoming capable at something new.</h2><p>Learn-To Trips are built around a skill rather than a sightseeing checklist. The destination matters, but the progression matters too. The right trip creates enough structure for beginners to learn safely while still feeling like a genuine journey.</p><h3>Examples</h3><ul><li>Learn to scuba dive</li><li>Learn to sail</li><li>Learn to surf</li><li>Learn to ski</li><li>Mountaineering progression</li><li>Wilderness and outdoor skills</li></ul><h3>For beginners and progressing groups</h3><p>Trips can be structured for complete beginners, mixed-ability groups, or communities that already have experience and want to develop further.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
